    "font": "Inter Display",
    "motion": "Calm and deliberate: elements ease in with soft cubic-out curves, then snap decisively when the accent arrives. The camera mostly holds still, with slow push-ins on the moment of clarity.",
    "story": "We move from chaos to restraint: a noisy, over-coloured opening on dark night gives way to clean paper-white scenes where a single coral accent does all the talking. Dark scenes frame problems and payoffs, light scenes carry the method, alternating wide systems views with close-ups on one element."
